                <mxCell id="4DbXpQDSfPJ9_RQCylcr-39" value="🗂 Use Intoxalock&#39;s existing service-center database&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;(locations, contacts, hours) — not a new build&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🌐 one-time upfront extraction enriches the DB with missing hours&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;🔬 spike: validate feasibility via Google Places API / scraping&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;✉ Service Center confirms / corrects hours via the Confirmation Page (email or SMS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#3b5b8c;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
