                            <mxPoint x="1140" y="250"/>
                            <mxPoint x="1460" y="250"/>
                        </Array>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="own-note-msg" value="&lt;b&gt;Customer-messaging is split&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;1Rivet sends the &lt;b&gt;acknowledgment&lt;/b&gt; (intake) and the &lt;b&gt;&amp;quot;appointment ready&amp;quot;&lt;/b&gt; confirmation. Source Meridian sends the keep-warm &lt;b&gt;Processing Reminder&lt;/b&gt; and the Phase-3 &lt;b&gt;Appointment Reminder / Non-Confirmation Warning&lt;/b&gt;. Open item: which team owns the consent records &amp;amp; message log that both write to?&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7e0;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#7a5b00;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;size=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="860" width="740" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="own-note-data" value="&lt;b&gt;Service-center data dependency&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Center contact + operating hours live in the 1Rivet &lt;b&gt;Service-Center DB&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;b&gt;v1 plan:&lt;/b&gt; forwarded to Source Meridian inside the &lt;b&gt;C1&lt;/b&gt; payload (no direct DB access). &lt;b&gt;Open alternative:&lt;/b&gt; a read API on the DB exposed to Source Meridian.&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7e0;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#7a5b00;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;size=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="800" y="860" width="720" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="own-contracts" value="&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;color:#232F3E&#39;&gt;&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:13px&#39;&gt;Integration Contract Registry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table width=&#39;100%&#39; cellpadding=&#39;6&#39; cellspacing=&#39;0&#39; border=&#39;1&#39; style=&#39;border-collapse:collapse;border-color:#c9d1d9;margin-top:8px&#39;&gt;&lt;tr style=&#39;background:#232F3E;color:#ffffff&#39;&gt;&lt;th width=&#39;4%&#39;&gt;#&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th width=&#39;18%&#39;&gt;Contract&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th width=&#39;17%&#39;&gt;Exposed by ← Called by&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th width=&#39;22%&#39;&gt;Trigger&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th width=&#39;39%&#39;&gt;Payload &amp;amp; Response (key fields)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;C1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Start Automated Confirmation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source Meridian&lt;/b&gt; ← &lt;b&gt;1Rivet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Intake passes the Eligibility Gate.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Req:&lt;/b&gt; requestId, customer{firstName, phone, email, consent}, assignedServiceCenter{id, contact, hours}, 2× preferredTimeRange, vehicle{make, model, year}, minimumLeadTime, eligibility=true. &lt;b&gt;Resp:&lt;/b&gt; 202 {confirmationId}.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&#39;background:#f5f7fa&#39;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;C2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Appointment Confirmed (→ Work Order + notify)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;1Rivet&lt;/b&gt; ← &lt;b&gt;Source Meridian&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Center pins an exact time on the Confirmation Page.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Req:&lt;/b&gt; requestId, confirmedDateTime, serviceCenterId, quote, confirmedBy. 1Rivet generates the Work Order in the system of record → &lt;b&gt;Resp:&lt;/b&gt; 200 {workOrderId} (success) or failure → SM escalates via C3. Idempotent on requestId; &amp;quot;confirmed&amp;quot; declared only after WO success, then 1Rivet notifies the customer.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;C3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Exception / Escalation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;1Rivet (Ticketing)&lt;/b&gt; ← &lt;b&gt;Source Meridian&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;No agreement, Work-Order failure, TTL expiry, or too little runway to run the ladder.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Req:&lt;/b&gt; requestId, reason, lastState, fullHistory[]. &lt;b&gt;Resp:&lt;/b&gt; 200 {ticketId}. The Intoxalock Representative works the ticket; reminders continue until resolved.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9AA0A6;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=10;arcSize=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="1000" width="1520" height="300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>